# Shell scripts must reach the container with LF endings.
#
# This checkout is on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, so without this a .sh
# committed here arrives in the build context with CRLF - and a shebang whose
# line ends in \r fails to exec with ENOENT. The only symptom is the tracker
# login panel reporting "failed" with no other trace anywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
